{
  "id": "section-160",
  "title": "对随军南下干部的讲话（摘录）",
  "level": 0,
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/2-009.htm",
  "html": "<table><tbody><tr><td> -&gt;  -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》</a><hr>\n<b>008）</b>\n\n\n<br>\n<br>\n　　还要学会两种本领，头一个是松树的本领，第二个是柳树的本领。松树发育成长，不怕刮风下雪，严寒之下也能巍然屹立。松树有“原则性”；柳树插到哪里都能活，一到春天，枝长叶茂，随风飘荡，十分可爱。柳树有“灵活性”。<br>\n<br>\n　　一个共产党员应该有松树的“原则性”和柳树的“灵活性”，缺一不行。<br><br><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/2-008.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">上一页</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">目录</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/2-010.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下一页</a><br><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n"
}
